WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:01.540
Dream.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.550
The day the dream began.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.400
The sunbeams streaming through the leaves were bright...

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.000
The touch of snow was cold...

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.740
The smell of the leaves was kind...

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.600
And, a small child was crying...

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.280
I can't remember the face of the crying child even today...

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.300
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

