00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:05.160
I'm taking a trip to eternity
eien no tabi wo shiteru

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:19.370
I continued the search on the cold tip of the finger
tsumetai yubisaki sagashi tsuzuketeta

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:24.740
It's burning from the fragments
kakera kara yaiteru

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:31.200
Hugging deep in my heart
tsuyoku mune ni dakishimete

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:38.280
The lost item that I was searching for
sagashiteita nakushimono

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.750
Checking for it in both of my hands
ryoute no naka tashikamete

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:57.130
The time that meets the new morning
atarashii asa ni deau toki ga ugakidasuyo

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:19.170
I've had this grudge for a long time. Now I'll settle the score.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:21.800
Get ready!

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.640
He... hey hey hey wait! I don't remember someone having a grudge against me.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:26.960
Shut up!!!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.450
Auuu...

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:40.190
Auuu, don't dodge.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.580
Don't say absurd things.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.190
First of all, why me?

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.250
You!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:52.710
Just One Small Memory

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:59.480
Auuu! Let go, let go, let go, let go, let go!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:06.940
Hey hey! Are you alright?

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:08.520
Shut up!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.000
You! You!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.530
I'm hungry...

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.540
Hey, come on! Hey!

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:18.850
Am I the bad guy?

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.090
Yuuichi-san.

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:22.980
A... Akiko-san. Why are you here?

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:23.070
I was shopping.
A... Akiko-san. Why are you here?

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:23.840
I was shopping.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.750
What's wrong?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.950
Um, it's not exactly "what" that's wrong...

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.720
Oh, she's covered with mud.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.370
Yuuichi-san, help me.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.000
We can't leave this girl like this.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:37.890
Right?

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.230
Ahh! It's hot.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.600
I'll bring out the futon now.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.110
Welcome back. What happened?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.580
I wanna ask that, sheesh.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.330
Yuuichi-san, please hurry.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.530
Yuuichi's the bad one.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.010
Hey wait! I'm the victim.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:22.870
She came after me on her own!

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:27.170
Quiet please.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.220
Yuuichi's insensitive.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.420
What do you mean by that?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:38.340
You could have caused her trouble at a time you no longer remember.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.070
I've never seen this face before.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.520
I'm the one who's in trouble.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.480
You little...

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:45.580
Stop it.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.930
Until she wakes up, why don't we leave her alone?

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.580
You can ask her about the circumstances afterwards.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:55.410
Right?

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:10.210
Even if there are circumstances, I don't remember anything.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.620
Or could I have just forgotten?

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:18.500
I can't remember...

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:20.500
...my childhood memories...

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.700
Auuu... I'm so hungry...

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.910
Is there anything to eat?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:52.750
Hey!!!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.580
Fumyuuu...

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:08.400
Auuu...?

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.080
It's troublesome to disturb the neighbors at this time.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.890
She was raiding the fridge.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:18.820
Good morning...

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.170
Are you hungry?

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:22.910
Auuu...

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.630
Wait a second please.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.850
I'll make you a midnight snack.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:32.140
Midnight snack?

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:35.390
Would you like one too, Yuuichi-san?

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.600
I'm sleepy...

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:42.750
Go to sleep then.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.590
And you, what's your name?

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:52.010
Phone number, birth date, blood type, the doctor you like.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:53.860
What's your name?

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.640
"Sawatari Makoto"...

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:59.290
Hey you.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:02.020
I only remember that.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.910
I don't remember anything else about me...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.290
Amnesia???

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:07.710
Yeah, I think...

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:10.230
Don't answer any non-committal things!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.120
Didn't you say something about a "grudge" to me?

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:18.360
How could someone who's lost her memory hold a grudge?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.310
It's true!

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:26.670
I don't know why, but when I see your face, I get very angry.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:32.160
Ah wait!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.330
Yuuichi-san.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.440
It was harsh to treat her like that.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:40.780
No way!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.500
Do the two of you really believe her?

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.100
About her story.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.780
This was in her pocket.

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:52.930
Oh, there's plenty of it.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.620
You shouldn't look without permission.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.050
It's to identify her.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.080
This is it, I guess.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:06.790
Yes.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:13.440
Let's assume she has amnesia. She seems to have a solid story.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.810
There's no clue of her friends or family...

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.740
Whatever the case, she has her own problems.

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:42.510
Yo!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.270
Good morning.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:48.010
Good morning. You two sure are early.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.920
Yeah, we woke up early.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.840
Well, we didn't get much sleep either.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.470
What were you doing?

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.620
Uh, it's a long story.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.890
It's fishy.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.600
Having a midnight study session with each other?

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.550
It wasn't like that.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.320
What's wrong, Yuuichi?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.320
Your face is red.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:25.680
Yuuichi-san.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.810
Skipping class isn't good.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:32.730
Look who's talking. Feeling better?

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.670
It looks like I still need more rest.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.810
Yuuichi-san, what happened?

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:42.180
Your face doesn't look too good.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:43.960
Um, it's a long story.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.590
Amnesia?

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.440
It's obviously a lie.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:54.430
She ran away from home and just can't go back.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:58.950
So she was wandering around trying to find someone who would feel sorry for her.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.700
Sheesh, she's a terrible girl.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.990
It sounds like fun.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:06.220
"Fun"?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.720
Isn't it kind of cool?

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.640
Amnesia, it's like in the dramas.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.990
Stop joking! The real world and dramas are different!

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.940
Yeah... you're right...

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.640
I'll be going back now.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.500
Sorry for making you listen to a one-sided complaint.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:33.300
It's okay.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:39.050
Shiori, you shouldn't be wandering about.

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.520
You should rest, otherwise your cold won't get better.

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:51.570
Sure. I understand.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.340
See you again, Shiori.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.640
If only she were that appealing, she'd be much better.

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:07.040
But that wasn't the only problem.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.000
Look here.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.690
This will be on the test, so remember it.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:14.690
IDIOT!

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.840
IDIOT! BLOCKHEAD!

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:23.950
What's wrong Aizawa? Do you like this test that much?

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.110
Eh? Ah... um... it's not like that.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:32.850
That girl!

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.830
Even though she bears grudges against others, does she need to go this far?

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.300
Are you alright?

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.560
Eh? Ah, it's okay.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:46.310
Sheesh, if she thinks that I'll give up after this, she's mistaken!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:53.670
Next, open your textbook to page 213.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:55.150
Ah, wa... wait a...

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.840
I'll lend you my notes later.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.440
S... Sorry.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.310
Auuu...

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.740
What the heck!?

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.650
What are you trying to do?

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:35.370
About what?

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.220
Aren't you the one who did it?

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.270
You also took my pencil apart and tore my eraser to pieces.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.760
I don't know anything.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:42.860
Don't lie.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:47.590
Listen, I've done pranks like this and also got caught.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.540
But, I don't take other people's things without asking!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:53.750
My wallet.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.060
The one that I put in the pocket of my uniform.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:13:00.190
I tried to buy lunch at the cafeteria today but I couldn't find it.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.830
I have no idea.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.030
Then who took it?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.570
I don't know, I really don't know.

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:14.420
Hey, isn't this my manga?

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:17.850
I went into your room, but I didn't take your wallet!

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.700
Come on. Who would believe you?

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:22.480
Get out!

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.450
You're the one who needs to get out!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.150
Hm? Something wrong?

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:35.050
Not really.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:35.900
Yuuichi-san.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.480
Is it okay if I ask a favor of you?

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:45.910
Sorry for making you come with me.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:47.910
You've really helped me.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:49.340
It's okay.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.720
But it's about her, right?

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:55.580
It turned out to be quite troublesome.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:00.110
I want to believe her, but...

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.920
it seems that it's useless to say anything to her.

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.810
We should just hand that big liar over to the police...

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:10.330
Yuuichi-kun!
We should just hand that big liar over to the police...

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:11.490
Yuuichi-kun!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.460
Yuuichi-kuuun!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.450
Ughuu, I fell again.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.740
Is she your friend?

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:27.950
I don't know her at all.

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:33.620
Ughuu. Yuuichi-kun, do you hate me that much?

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.240
Nope, I don't.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:36.280
Here!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.160
She's an energetic girl.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:43.580
Um.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:46.050
I'll introduce her.

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:49.360
She's the one taking care of me right now, my aunt Minase Akiko-san.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:50.580
Hello.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.990
Nice to meet you. I'm Tsukimiya Ayu.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.100
"Tsukimiya.. Ayu-chan.."?

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:58.310
Yes!

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.350
What's wrong?

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.160
Is there something on my face?

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:08.350
Two eyes and one nose.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:13.750
Ughuu... Yuuichi-kun, do you seriously hate me?

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:15.920
You hate me, you hate me, you hate me!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.530
That's not true.
You hate me, you hate me, you hate me!

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:17.720
You hate me, you hate me, you hate me!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:21.980
Sorry, I think it's my imagination.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.910
It shouldn't be.

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.430
Hey, what were you doing?

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:31.810
Shopping.

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.310
Were you avoiding the bills Ayu...?

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:34.690
I wasn't.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.320
Were you about to?

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:37.670
No, I wasn't!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:38.560
Then what?

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.420
Um... I'm looking for something.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:42.780
"Looking for something"???

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.250
Something I dropped.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:46.860
Did you drop your wallet?

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:49.010
It's not like that.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:50.750
It's something more precious.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.450
What I dropped was...

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:55.060
Huh? What was it?

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.190
It's a precious thing...

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:03.850
And I need to find it soon...

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:05.800
I can't remember...

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:14.530
Calm down.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.820
You can't find it if you're rushing about, but...

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:20.180
There are times when you should calm down and search everywhere.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.900
Yeah, I'll find it.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:28.000
Well, if you don't know what you're looking for, it's out of the question.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.030
Ughuu...

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.850
Search hard. I'll cheer you on.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:35.280
Yeah, see you again.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.240
She seems to be a good girl.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:50.030
Okay, I think our introduction wasn't finished.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.430
I'm "Minase Nayuki".

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.060
Call me "Nayuki".

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:57.030
This is my mother.

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.460
And my cousin "Yuuichi".

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.220
(Note: Usotsuki is a liar. He made up the name to refer to her as a liar.)
And then, we have "Uso Tsukiko-san".

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:03.600
Who is?

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:06.210
(Note: Saifu is a wallet. Suri means to pickpocket. He's calling her a pickpocket.)
Huh? Then was it "Saifu Surinosuke"?

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.160
What the hell was that for?

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.560
My name isn't that weird!

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:17.030
My name is "Sawatari Makoto".

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:19.140
Do you have proof?

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:22.400
Proof that you're "Sawatari Makoto"!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.570
Auuu...

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.310
See, you don't have any.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.380
If you want me to call your name properly,

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:31.390
then apologize by saying "I'm sorry to have taken your wallet"!

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.220
Auuuu...

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:34.770
Stop it, you two.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.680
Ah wait. Wallet...?

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.130
My wallet. She stole it.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:43.230
I did not steal it!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:44.690
Sorry.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.340
That's me...

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.850
You dropped this yesterday while you were carrying her,

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:02.200
so I picked it up and planned to give it back later, but...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:03.620
Sorry.

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.460
No, it was my fault.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:17.260
It was my fault, but you're also at fault.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.260
Auuu...

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:20.680
Isn't it?

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:25.270
First of all, if you didn't come after me, this wouldn't have happened.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:26.640
You think so?

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:27.880
Yes, I do!

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:31.030
First of all, why me?

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:34.680
I don't even remember doing anything that you would hold a grudge against.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.100
You're sure you haven't mistaken me for someone else?

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:41.980
I'm sure of it!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.980
I begin to remember things when I talk with you.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:46.110
I'm sure that you're the one!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.130
Are you serious?

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:55.820
I forgot many things, but when I found you, I remembered one thing!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.840
That "I'm abomination to him".

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:04.050
You're my only guide.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:06.160
Guide?

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:08.200
I see.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:12.940
If you're with Yuuichi, you might remember something.

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:19.980
Hey, until her memory comes back, why don't we let her stay?

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:21.980
Hey, wait a sec! I...

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:23.680
Approved.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.770
That's great. Now, let's eat.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:28.630
Are you serious???

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.290
It's "Makoto"...

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:38.510
My name... it's Sawatari Makoto...

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:40.600
Yuuichi...

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.890
Okay, nice to meet you, "Makoto".

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.370
Yuuichi... Give my notes back...

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.310
"Notes"...?

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:07.770
I lent them to you.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.570
My notes.

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.470
Notes...

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:16.510
Did you forget them?

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:19.600
Sorry. I'll give them back at school tomorrow.

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:22.780
My... notes...

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:26.720
Okay. I'll go to the school and the the notes.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.270
I think the school is closed.

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:32.200
Maybe there's a teacher on night duty.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.010
It's cold outside.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:34.910
It's okay.

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:45.190
To tell the truth, I wanted a breath of fresh air.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.350
My stupidity that made false charges against her,

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:52.920
made me breathe harder...

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.810
She surprised me...

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.140
What is she doing? Practicing for the drama club?

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:36.200
Sei!!

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:57.690
Hey, wait a sec.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:58.970
What was that?

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:01.640
Hey, I said wait!

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:04.340
I am...

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:07.660
One who defeats monsters...

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:30.270
In between the flowing clouds
nagareru kunono aimani

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:36.010
The crawling blue sky
muzuita aozora ga

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:41.690
Even causes the familiar town
minareta machinami de sae

00:22:41.950 --> 00:22:47.160
To light up
kagayakasete kureru

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:53.000
Running small back
kaketeku chiisana senaka

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:58.890
The two at that time were...
anokoro no futariga

00:22:59.300 --> 00:23:04.310
The reason for the spilling pain
koboreru itami no wakewo

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:10.050
Hidden with innocence
mujyakisa de kakushita

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:18.420
Time is flowing quietly
tokiwa shizukani nagare

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:24.050
The gentle winds blow
yasashii kaze ga fuita

00:23:24.300 --> 00:23:29.680
Numbed feelings too will
Kajikanda omoimo

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:35.930
Change to a smile
egao ni kawarukara

